rch for clues in every room. Solving puzzles unlocks new areas and accelerates the story, heightening tension with each step forward.<strong>  <br>   <br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0fButterfly Effect </strong>Some action take impacts the story. Will your choices lead to salvation or ruin?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f3 Endings  </strong>The ending depends on your actions throughout the story. Miss a crucial detail, and you might lose the chance to uncover the truth.<strong>   <br>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222530/extras/e1cec920a2777bbdc8fabb1e945309d2.avif?t=1752805196\" width=639 height=160 /></span><strong></strong></p>",
